    <string name="xrgame_launch_msaa_forced">Off while eye-tracked foveation is on: Turnip foveates only passes that do not load or store multisampled images.</string>
    <string name="xrgame_launch_foveation_game_note">\"Eye\" gives the game the eye gaze for its own foveation (ETFR) and turns its MSAA off.</string>
    <string name="xrgame_launch_etfr_debug">ETFR debug view</string>
    <string name="xrgame_launch_etfr_debug_note">A green cross where the eye gaze lands in each eye (magenta in the centre while there is no gaze). Turnip tints what fragment density map passes draw by fragment area, keeping its brightness: green 2, yellow 4, orange 8, red 16 pixels; our upscaling tints by density too. Uses the Vulkan composite.</string>
